  "caption": "Two MecCog hypotheses split the cellular bottleneck. H2 proposes that APOE4 impairs ApoER2 recycling in early endosomes, where the exchanger NHE6 sets pH. In H5, APOE4 astrocytes show 3-fold more cholesterol colocalized with lysosomes, and APOE4 microglia downregulate 53 of 84 lysosomal hydrolases and V-ATPases. Every row clicks straight back to its verbatim quote.",
